   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHIA reform &#xd6;st 2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fram support to SHIA 2010. SHIA is working in cooperation with a number of CSO&apos;s in Eastern Europe, which supports people with disabilities. The aim is to contribute to people with disabilities and their possibilites to improve their living conditions and to claim their rights.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramst&#xf6;d till SHIAs verksamhet 2010. SHIA arbetar tillsammand med ett antal CSO&apos;s i &#xd6;stra Europa, som st&#xf6;djer m&#xe4;nniskor med  funktionshinder. Syftet &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja funktionshindrades m&#xf6;jligheter att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra sina levnadsvillkor och att utkr&#xe4;va sina r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
